          "docs": "Update organization's run-execution settings.\n\n- kernel_headless_mode: When enabled, runs browsers headless (no LiveView,\n  no replays) and disables BrowserUse agent vision.\n- max_concurrent_browsers: Maximum number of concurrent parallel browser\n  sessions."
        },
